Exact source commits, original Git author metadata, adoption boundaries and
adaptations are recorded in docs/fork-adoption.md and docs/fork-adoption.tsv. Overlapping fixes are not claimed as new work.

custom_components/owlet/owletapi adapts the bundled client from
LucasVollebergh/owlet and idomp/owlet. It derives from pyowletapi-ng at
https://github.com/lucasvollebergh/pyowletapi, based on Ryan Clark's pyowletapi.
